{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"product_name\":\"机场反无应用\",\"product_name_en\":\"Airport Anti-UAV Application\",\"summary\":\"针对机场周边及进近航线等敏感净空区域进行7x24小时全时段护卫，阻断“黑飞”无人机干扰航班正常起降的威胁。采用无线电侦测与压制联动，配合导航欺骗，确保机场净空安全，保障民用航空秩序。\",\"summary_en\":\"Providing 24/7 protection for sensitive clearance areas such as airport surroundings and approach routes, blocking 'black-flight' UAVs from interfering with normal takeoff and landing. Linkage of wireless detection, suppression, and navigation deception ensures airport clearance safety and maintains civil aviation order.\",\"key_application\":\"\",\"key_application_en\":\"\",\"key_parameter_1\":\"敏感净空保障: 对机场周边及进近航线进行7x24小时全时段护卫\",\"key_parameter_1_en\":\"Sensitive Clearance Protection: 24/7 guarding of airport surroundings and approach routes\",\"key_parameter_2\":\"多措并举反制: 整合无线电侦测、诱骗与压制，杜绝“黑飞”干扰航班\",\"key_parameter_2_en\":\"Multi-layered Countermeasures: Integrated wireless detection, decoy, and suppression against unauthorized flights\",\"parameters\":{\"系统组成\":\"雷达探测-光电同步-反制联动\",\"干扰频段\":\"涵盖全民用及特殊频段\",\"防御半径\":\"3km - 10km 可定制\",\"技术合规\":\"符合民航反无人机技术标准\"},\"parameters_en\":\"{\\\"Components\\\":\\\"Radar-EO-Countermeasure linkage\\\",\\\"Frequencies\\\":\\\"Covers all civil and special bands\\\",\\\"Defense Radius\\\":\\\"3km - 10km customizable\\\",\\\"Compliance\\\":\\\"Meets civil aviation anti-UAV standards\\\"}\",\"detail_html\":\"<h4>机场防护详解</h4><p>机场是反无人机的高敏感区域，对反制设备的频率管控要求极高。我们的系统在干扰非法无人机的同时，不影响塔台通信与波道导航。</p><ul><li>保护起降净空区域</li><li>多手段联动响应</li><li>实时记录与存证</li></ul>\",\"detail_html_en\":\"<h4>Airport Defense Details</h4><p>Airports are highly sensitive areas for anti-UAV operations, requiring extreme precision in frequency control. Our system neutralizes illegal drones without interfering with tower communications or navigation beacons.</p><ul><li>Protecting takeoff/landing clearance</li><li>Multi-layered linkage response</li><li>Real-time recording and evidence storage</li></ul>\",\"main_image\":\"/solution